{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How high can you go? Find out in Go Up, the relaxing and atmospheric idle game that never stops.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect dust, spice, and chaos as you ascend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/GoldenDust.gif?t=1748661533\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Burn <strong>Spice</strong> to boost and accumulate <strong>Chaos</strong> to trigger a random <strong>Chaos Event</strong>. Collect enough <strong>Dust</strong> and you\u2019ll earn a <strong>Golden Dust</strong> to spend on upgrading your character.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Journey through vast and varied environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/Boost.gif?t=1748661533\" />Travel through 11 unique and vibrant regions as you traverse the realms, ascending from the pits of \ud83d\udd25<strong>Tartarus</strong>\ud83d\udd25 through \u2740<strong>Elysium</strong>\u2740 and beyond into the  heavenly \u2727<strong>Cosmos</strong>\u2727.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>If you\u2019re not going up, you\u2019re going down</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press any button to Go Up, but don\u2019t stop pressing, or you will go down. When the game is not running, you are falling, so keep your finger on that button!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Spend Golden Dust to purchase upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/skill_tree_640x360.png?t=1748661533\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An expansive skill tree offers over 50 unique skills to help you Go Up faster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019ve got \ud83e\uddf2<strong>Magnets</strong>\ud83e\uddf2. <br>We\u2019ve got <strong>\ud83d\ude80Boosters\ud83d\ude80</strong>. <br>We\u2019ve got <strong>\u23ebAccelerators\u23eb</strong> and \ud83d\udeab\u23ec<strong>Anti-Decelarators</strong>\u23ec\ud83d\udeab.<br>And lots of other upgrades that you'll have to play the game to find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or you can save up your <strong>Golden Dust</strong> for the ultimate purchase, the skill that lets you Go Up <i>automatically</i> without a single button press. True idle perfection.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Global and Friend High Scores</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/high_score_640x360.jpg?t=1748661533\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with your friends and the world to see who can get the highest. Pass the ghostly echo of another player\u2019s high score to trigger a random <strong>Chaos Event</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u266b \u266a \u266c<strong> Music to put you in the zone\u00a0</strong>\u266b \u266a \u266c</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vibe to the chill ambient tones of exclusive music by Stephen Garza.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2934520?t=1748661533","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/5090fede6f250159dd929a1a87631e73dd9629cb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748661533","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/f4e103b2da764acad1c65369057efb234ace20cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748661533","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/f4e103b2da764acad1c65369057efb234ace20cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748661533","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How high can you go? Find out in Go Up, the relaxing and atmospheric idle game that never stops.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect dust, spice, and chaos as you ascend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/GoldenDust.gif?t=1748661533\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Burn <strong>Spice</strong> to boost and accumulate <strong>Chaos</strong> to trigger a random <strong>Chaos Event</strong>. Collect enough <strong>Dust</strong> and you\u2019ll earn a <strong>Golden Dust</strong> to spend on upgrading your character.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Journey through vast and varied environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/Boost.gif?t=1748661533\" />Travel through 11 unique and vibrant regions as you traverse the realms, ascending from the pits of \ud83d\udd25<strong>Tartarus</strong>\ud83d\udd25 through \u2740<strong>Elysium</strong>\u2740 and beyond into the  heavenly \u2727<strong>Cosmos</strong>\u2727.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>If you\u2019re not going up, you\u2019re going down</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press any button to Go Up, but don\u2019t stop pressing, or you will go down. When the game is not running, you are falling, so keep your finger on that button!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Spend Golden Dust to purchase upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/skill_tree_640x360.png?t=1748661533\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An expansive skill tree offers over 50 unique skills to help you Go Up faster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019ve got \ud83e\uddf2<strong>Magnets</strong>\ud83e\uddf2. <br>We\u2019ve got <strong>\ud83d\ude80Boosters\ud83d\ude80</strong>. <br>We\u2019ve got <strong>\u23ebAccelerators\u23eb</strong> and \ud83d\udeab\u23ec<strong>Anti-Decelarators</strong>\u23ec\ud83d\udeab.<br>And lots of other upgrades that you'll have to play the game to find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or you can save up your <strong>Golden Dust</strong> for the ultimate purchase, the skill that lets you Go Up <i>automatically</i> without a single button press. True idle perfection.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Global and Friend High Scores</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/extras/high_score_640x360.jpg?t=1748661533\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with your friends and the world to see who can get the highest. Pass the ghostly echo of another player\u2019s high score to trigger a random <strong>Chaos Event</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u266b \u266a \u266c<strong> Music to put you in the zone\u00a0</strong>\u266b \u266a \u266c</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vibe to the chill ambient tones of exclusive music by Stephen Garza.</p>","developers":["Noble Whale Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934520/f8dd1010d533dd7493d22eade6caec2ed9a2ab02/header.jpg?t=1748661533","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any modern Linux distro<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 - 6600, or AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050, AMD Radeon RX460<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><u